</td></tr>
<tr>
<th> Publication
</th>
<td> <a href=\"https://grey.colorado.edu/CompCogNeuro/index.php/OReillyMunakataFrankEtAl12\" title=\"OReillyMunakataFrankEtAl12\">(O'Reilly, Munakata, Frank, Hazy, &amp; Contributors, 2012)</a>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th> First Published
</th>
<td> Jul 28 2016
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th> Tags
</th>
<td>  Constraint Satisfaction, Settling, Harmony, Energy Minimization, Adaptation
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th> Description
</th>
<td>  Simulates the competition between two interepretations of the Necker Cube, and the constraint-satisfaction process of settling into one interpretation.
</td></tr>
<tr>
